governor turn 3: accept  (The oracle is green: tsc reports no errors and all 19 vitest tests pass. The manifest shows Todo with `completed: boolean` and no `done` field. All four units were updated in round 2. The approved test edits only renamed the fixture or property access, and the assertions stayed the same. ListOptions.includeDone was deliberately left alone because it is an option name, not the Todo field.)

